teness of restraint type was based on age, weight, and parent-reported height using child passenger safety guidelines\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"assumed that 69 children aged <8 years with missing heights were <57 inches tall\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"correlation coefficient = 0.96, p<0.0001\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}